<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT SECURITY</p><h1>Ganti Password</h1><p class="page-subtitle">Gunakan password yang kuat dan berbeda dari password lainnya.</p></div></div>
<div class="password-page-grid"><section class="panel password-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Perbarui kredensial</h2><p>Password minimal 3 karakter.</p></div><span class="settings-icon">▣</span></div><form method="post" class="form-stack"><?= mc_csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="change_password"><div class="field-group"><label for="current_password">Password saat ini</label><input class="input-control" id="current_password" type="password" name="current_password" required autocomplete="current-password"></div><div class="field-group"><label for="new_password">Password baru</label><input class="input-control" id="new_password" type="password" name="new_password" minlength="3" required autocomplete="new-password"></div><div class="field-group"><label for="confirm_password">Konfirmasi password baru</label><input class="input-control" id="confirm_password" type="password" name="confirm_password" minlength="3" required autocomplete="new-password"></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Simpan Password</button></form></section><aside class="password-tips"><h3>Tips password aman</h3><ul><li>Minimal 3 karakter.</li><li>Gabungkan huruf besar, huruf kecil, angka, dan simbol.</li><li>Jangan gunakan nama atau tanggal lahir.</li><li>Jangan bagikan password kepada pengguna lain.</li></ul></aside></div>
